== Overview ==
The mafia toilet is a [[Rare]] unit that was added in the [[Episode 77 Part 1 Update]] he’s only a [[Rare]] but he’s pretty strong though.

== Appearance ==
The Mafia Toilet has a metal toilet bowl, with two spider legs and what seems to be a breastplate for the toilet. It also has multiple weapons such as a saw, a toxic waste barrel, a jetpack(?), and a blaster.

